              All adults (18+) must present a <strong>REAL ID-compliant license</strong> (look for the gold/black star) or a valid U.S. passport to pass through TSA security on domestic flights. Standard driver's licenses without the star are no longer accepted.
            </p>
            <a href="https://www.tsa.gov/real-id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline mt-1">
